# The default QCCD machine as Goal 3 judges it: the rule set `standard` (this website's machine, the
# rules every board entry is checked against) and R34, the team's feedback F2 (Ke, 2026-11-07), which
# Goal 3 applies to every architecture: a laser step addresses one chain position.  `standard` itself
# is left as it is: the boards judge by it.

ruleset "grid-deck";
title "The default QCCD grid, as Goal 3 judges it";
about "A lattice of X-junctions with a trap on every rail between them, every ion shuttled by itself, judged by this website's standard rules, and a laser step reaches one chain position: where a trap holds two ions, a pulse reaches the ones at the same position in every trap it plays in.";

include "standard";

use R34;
